1.Question:
Student Class and Object

Program:
class Student {
    String name;
    int rollNo;

    void display() {
        System.out.println("Student Name: " + name);
        System.out.println("Roll Number: " + rollNo);
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Student s1 = new Student();

        s1.name = "Anusuya";
        s1.rollNo = 5187;

        s1.display();
    }
}

Output:
Student Name: Anusuya
Roll Number: 5187

